---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Julie Bale"
  description="Privacy Policy for juliebale.com — how Julie Bale collects, uses, and protects your personal data."
>
  <Hero
    height="banner"
    bgColor="var(--color-charcoal)"
    heading="Privacy Policy"
    subheading="How I collect, use, and protect your personal information."
    textColor="light"
  />

  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>Who I Am</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by Julie Bale, trading as Diva Energy®. My registered business
        address is available on request. For data protection enquiries, please contact me at
        <a href="/contact">juliebale.com/contact</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What Personal Data I Collect</h2>
      <p>I collect personal data in the following ways:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact forms:</strong> Name, email address, and the content of your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> Name and email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Programme enrolment:</strong> Name, email address, payment details, and any information you share during coaching sessions. Payment processing is handled by Kajabi's secure payment provider and I do not store card details.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Aggregated, anonymised data about how visitors use this website, collected via Google Analytics 4. This requires your consent (see Cookie Policy below).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How I Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiries and provide the services you have requested.</li>
        <li>To send you my newsletter, if you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
        <li>To administer your programme enrolment and deliver my coaching services.</li>
        <li>To improve this website and understand how it is being used (analytics, with consent).</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For newsletter sign-ups and analytics cookies.</li>
        <li><strong>Contract:</strong> For processing data necessary to deliver a service you have purchased.</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> For responding to enquiries and improving my services.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>I do not sell your personal data. I share data only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Kajabi</strong> — my membership platform, which processes enrolments and email delivery. Their privacy policy is available at kajabi.com.</li>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> — for Google Analytics and Google Ads, with your consent.</li>
        <li><strong>Meta (Facebook)</strong> — for Meta Pixel analytics, with your consent.</li>
        <li>Processors required by law (e.g., HMRC).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        I retain your data for as long as necessary to deliver the service you have requested,
        and for up to 7 years for financial and legal records. Newsletter subscribers' data is
        retained until you unsubscribe.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data I hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data (in certain circumstances)</li>
        <li>Object to or restrict processing</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with the ICO (ico.org.uk)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, please <a href="/contact">contact me</a>.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses cookies. A cookie consent banner is displayed on your first visit.
        Strictly necessary cookies (for site functionality) are used without consent.
        Analytics and marketing cookies (Google Analytics, Meta Pixel) require your consent
        before they are loaded.
      </p>
      <p>You can update your cookie preferences at any time using the cookie settings link in the footer.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        I take appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data.
        This website is served over HTTPS. Payment data is processed by Kajabi's PCI-compliant
        payment infrastructure.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be
        communicated via email to active subscribers and will be reflected in the
        "Last updated" date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy-related questions, please use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-teal-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-body h2:first-of-type {
    border-top: none;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-grey);
    line-height: var(--leading-loose);
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--color-teal-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }
</style>
